WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.266
Vinnie slammed the album shut.

2
00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:09.215
"Did you see that?" he asked, his voice shaking.

3
00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:11.565
"That pyramid was glowing!"

4
00:00:11.566 --> 00:00:14.511
Mandy nodded slowly.

5
00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:17.800
"Should we tell Mom and Dad?"

6
00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:19.533
Vinnie shook his head.

7
00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:22.946
"No, this is our little secret."

8
00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:28.382
"There was something written below the picture," Mandy said.

9
00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:31.223
"Maybe we should read it."

10
00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:34.401
Vinnie nodded and opened the album.

11
00:00:34.402 --> 00:00:37.287
The handwriting was small and neat.

12
00:00:37.288 --> 00:00:45.345
"‘August 24, my first photo travels,’" Mandy read aloud.

13
00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:50.447
"Photo travels? What’s that?" Vinnie interrupted.

14
00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:53.078
Mandy continued to read.

15
00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:57.424
"‘I found this photo album in my uncle’s attic.

16
00:00:57.425 --> 00:01:01.008
It didn’t look special on the outside.

17
00:01:01.009 --> 00:01:06.609
But once I opened it, it changed my life forever.’"

18
00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:11.554
"So he found the album in an attic too," said Vinnie.

19
00:01:11.555 --> 00:01:14.971
Nodding, Mandy continued to read.

20
00:01:14.972 --> 00:01:17.552
"‘People say I’m crazy.

21
00:01:17.553 --> 00:01:19.441
Maybe I am.

22
00:01:19.442 --> 00:01:22.952
But I have traveled to the past.

23
00:01:22.953 --> 00:01:27.753
I even have proof—this photo album.’"

24
00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.772
"Travel to the past?

25
00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:34.177
Like in a time machine?" Vinnie asked excitedly.

26
00:01:34.178 --> 00:01:35.959
"Go on reading!"

27
00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:44.284
"'My first travel—to Egypt . . .'" Mandy held her breath.

28
00:01:44.285 --> 00:01:48.222
"'A glowing pyramid called to me.'"

29
00:01:48.223 --> 00:01:54.422
"Mandy, do you think it’s calling to us too?" Vinnie asked.

30
00:01:54.423 --> 00:01:57.247
He pulled the photo out of the album.

31
00:01:57.248 --> 00:02:04.034
Mandy continued, "’When I looked into the light, my adventures began.’"

32
00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:06.669
"But how did he go back in time?

33
00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.609
And why do the pictures glow?"

34
00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.207
Vinnie stared at the photo.

35
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:16.077
"Vinnie, maybe we should forget all this."

36
00:02:16.078 --> 00:02:18.601
Mandy looked at her watch.

37
00:02:18.602 --> 00:02:21.154
It was almost noon.

38
00:02:21.155 --> 00:02:24.148
"Let’s just go and have lunch."

39
00:02:24.149 --> 00:02:26.865
But Vinnie did not hear her.

40
00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:30.033
His eyes were fixed on the photograph.

41
00:02:30.034 --> 00:02:35.418
"Vinnie, you’re scaring me! Stop it!" she cried.

42
00:02:35.419 --> 00:02:38.085
"But what if it’s real?

43
00:02:38.086 --> 00:02:41.685
What if we really could go back in time?"

44
00:02:41.686 --> 00:02:44.471
Vinnie said in a dreamy voice.

45
00:02:44.472 --> 00:02:48.995
"I’m going downstairs," Mandy insisted.

46
00:02:48.996 --> 00:02:51.271
Vinnie grabbed her arm.

47
00:02:51.272 --> 00:02:56.400
"Don’t you want an adventure, Mandy?" he said excitedly.

48
00:02:56.401 --> 00:03:01.356
"I do, but I’m also scared," she said honestly.

49
00:03:01.357 --> 00:03:04.591
"How do we travel to the past?

50
00:03:04.592 --> 00:03:08.899
And I’m worried about how we’d get back home again."

51
00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.505
"Mandy," her brother suddenly shouted.

52
00:03:12.506 --> 00:03:15.740
"The pyramid is getting brighter!"

53
00:03:15.741 --> 00:03:21.147
Sure enough, the pyramid was glowing with a bright yellow light.

54
00:03:21.148 --> 00:03:26.011
Now the children really couldn’t take their eyes off the light.

55
00:03:26.012 --> 00:03:30.542
"’When I looked into the light, my adventures began.’"

56
00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:34.715
Vinnie repeated the words written in the album.

57
00:03:34.716 --> 00:03:38.629
The heat from the light felt hot against their faces.

58
00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.667
It forced them to close their eyes.

59
00:03:41.668 --> 00:03:45.321
Now they could see the pyramid in their minds.

60
00:03:45.322 --> 00:03:48.268
It seemed to be coming closer.

61
00:03:48.269 --> 00:03:53.271
"Vinnie, I’m scared," cried Mandy.

62
00:03:53.272 --> 00:03:57.933
Suddenly, the children felt their feet lift off the ground.

63
00:03:57.934 --> 00:04:03.484
Vinnie grabbed his sister’s hand and shouted, "Hang on, Mandy!"

64
00:04:03.485 --> 00:04:06.300
He held her hand tightly.

65
00:04:06.301 --> 00:04:08.154
"I’ve changed my mind!

66
00:04:08.155 --> 00:04:11.468
I don’t want to do this!" Vinnie cried.

67
00:04:11.469 --> 00:04:14.919
He tried to open his eyes, but couldn’t.

68
00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.025
It was too bright.

69
00:04:17.026 --> 00:04:18.825
"Mandy!"

70
00:04:18.826 --> 00:04:20.215
"Vinnie!"

71
00:04:20.216 --> 00:04:24.468
Still holding on to each other, the children screamed.

72
00:04:24.469 --> 00:04:31.326
They began to fall down a deep dark tunnel.

